  all-traces
  "∀ S I newK oldK #x.
    ((SessionKeyRhangeover( S, I, newK, oldK ) @ #x) ∧
     (¬(∃ #r. LtkReveal( S ) @ #r))) ⇒
    (∃ #y. (SessionKey( S, I, oldK ) @ #y) ∧ (#y < #x))"
/*
guarded formula characterizing all counter-examples:
"∃ S I newK oldK #x.
  (SessionKeyRhangeover( S, I, newK, oldK ) @ #x)
 ∧
